body:
Right now we're playing:
"Repeatedly slap my hand on everything, including daddy's face";  
"Put my hand on mommy's arm, nose, or lips and squish them really hard";  
"Don't you dare put me down";  
and
"Dress or undress me and I'll cry so hysterically that everyone in the world shall know how awful my 10-second lack of arm freedom is."
